cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CSG-Skin: domain-adversarial training and out-of-distribution monitoring in skin lesion classification"
message: "If you use this code or the accompanying manuscript, please cite this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Tran"
    given-names: "Duc Vinh"
    email: "tranducvinh2004@gmail.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TranDucVinh-20225538/CSG-SKin"
abstract: >-
  Code and manuscript for a controlled study of what domain-adversarial
  invariance training does to out-of-distribution monitoring. Sweeping the
  adversarial weight shows OOD detection collapsing below chance while
  in-distribution accuracy, in-distribution calibration and the domain leakage
  probe all continue to look correct.
keywords:
  - domain-adversarial training
  - out-of-distribution detection
  - calibration
  - distribution shift
  - skin lesion classification
